ary-dark)] text-white py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Verstehen, was entschieden wird.</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-[var(--secondary)] mb-8 leading-relaxed\">Die Plattform für transparente Stadtratsentscheidungen in Moosburg. Einfach erklärt, barrierefrei zugänglich, für alle Bürger:innen.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn-accent inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/antraege\">📋 Alle Anträge ansehen</a><a class=\"px-6 py-3 border-2 border-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-white hover:text-[var(--primary)] transition-colors\" href=\"/ueber-uns\">Mehr erfahren</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-white border-b\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"text-center p-4\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--primary)]\">4</p><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Anträge gesamt</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--success)]\">2</p><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Angenommen</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--warning)]\">1</p><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">In Beratung</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--accent)]\">1798</p><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Bürgerstimmen</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[var(--secondary)] py-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl flex-shrink-0\">🏛️</div><div><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--primary)]\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Nächste Stadtratssitzung</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-dark)]\">Freitag, 13. Dezember 2024<!-- --> um <!-- -->19:00<!-- --> Uhr</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">📍 <!-- -->Rathaus Moosburg, Großer Sitzungssaal</p></div></div><a class=\"btn-primary text-sm\" href=\"/sitzungen\">Tagesordnung ansehen →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 md:py-16 bg-[var(--neutral-light)]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--neutral-dark)]\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Aktuelle Anträge</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mt-1\">Die neuesten Entscheidungen im Überblick</p></div><a class=\"text-[var(--primary)] font-medium hover:underline hidden md:block\" href=\"/antraege\">Alle anzeigen →</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><a href=\"/antrag/1\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#0077B620\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Verkehr</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-success\">Angenommen</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Tempo 30 in der Altstadt</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Die Geschwindigkeit in der gesamten Altstadt soll auf 30 km/h begrenzt werden, um die Sicherheit für Fußgänger und Radfahrer zu erhöhen.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->18</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->6</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:69.23076923076923%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:30.769230769230774%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Altstadt</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/2\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#EF476F20\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Soziales &amp; Familie</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-success\">Angenommen</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Neuer Spielplatz am Stadtpark</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Im Stadtpark soll ein moderner, barrierefreier Spielplatz für Kinder aller Altersgruppen entstehen.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->24</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->0</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:92.3076923076923%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:7.692307692307693%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Stadtpark</span><span>💬 <!-- -->1</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/3\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#06D6A020\">🌱</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Umwelt &amp; Klima</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-warning\">In Beratung</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Photovoltaik auf städtischen Gebäuden</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Alle geeigneten städtischen Gebäude sollen mit Solaranlagen ausgestattet werden, um die Klimaziele zu erreichen.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->15.11.2024</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a><a href=\"/antrag/4\"><article class=\"card p-5 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer h-full flex flex-col\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg\" style=\"background-color:#0077B620\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">Verkehr</span></div><span class=\"badge badge-danger\">Abgelehnt</span></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2 line-clamp-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Erhöhung der Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow\">Die Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt sollen von 1€ auf 1,50€ pro Stunde erhöht werden.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-1\"><span>Dafür: <!-- -->8</span><span>Dagegen: <!-- -->16</span></div><div class=\"h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)]\" style=\"width:30.76923076923077%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)]\" style=\"width:69.23076923076923%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] pt-3 border-t border-gray-100\"><span>📅 <!-- -->18.10.2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Innenstadt</span><span>💬 <!-- -->2</span></div></article></a></div><div class=\"mt-8 text-center md:hidden\"><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/antraege\">Alle Anträge anzeigen</a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 md:py-16 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Themen durchstöbern</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\"><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=verkehr\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Verkehr</span></a><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=umwelt\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">🌱</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Umwelt &amp; Klima</span></a><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=soziales\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Soziales &amp; Familie</span></a><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=finanzen\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">💰</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Finanzen</span></a><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=kultur\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">🎭</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Kultur &amp; Bildung</span></a><a class=\"card p-4 text-center hover:scale-105\" href=\"/antraege?kategorie=bau\"><span class=\"text-3xl mb-2 block\">🏗️</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Bauen &amp; Wohnen</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 md:py-16 bg-[var(--accent)]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-[var(--neutral-dark)]\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Deine Meinung zählt!</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--neutral-dark)] mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Gib deine symbolische Stimme zu den Anträgen ab und zeige, was die Bürger:innen von Moosburg wirklich denken.</p><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/antraege\">Jetzt abstimmen →</a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--neutral-dark)] text-white mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl\">M</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-lg\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Moosburg Transparent</h2></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Eine Initiative für mehr Transparenz in der Kommunalpolitik. Wir machen Stadtratsentscheidungen verständlich und zugänglich für alle Bürger:innen.</p><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs mt-4\">Ein Projekt im Rahmen des Service Design Studiums an der Hochschule München.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-[var(--accent)]\">Navigation</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Dashboard</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/antraege\">Alle Anträge</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/karte\">Stadtkarte</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/abstimmungen\">Abstimmungen</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-[var(--accent)]\">Kontakt</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400\"><li>📧 info@moosburg-transparent.de</li><li>🏛️ Stadt Moosburg a.d. Isar</li><li>📍 Stadtplatz 13, 85368 Moosburg</li></ul></div></div><div cl